Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Done:  Get MMF account -ve test case (book not CAPITAL/MMF -> 400 MMF003)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mmf/accounts/2939418?book=FOO
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Done: List sweep-ins
